OVOS installation status relay

The server, vendor recipe codec and four SQLite migrations in this directory
are copied from ovos-install-status, commit
89eee176ba71b80a522cd1d249f61e12286b1188 (version 1.4.1).

Original project: OpenVoiceOS installation wizard contributors.
License: Apache-2.0; see the repository's LICENSE file.

The Node transport, browser authentication and SQLite adapter are separate
files in server/node-*.mjs. Existing capability lifetimes, status transitions,
report URL validation and SQL bindings remain in the original relay modules.

Migration change: server/launch.mjs pins launcher commit
40f9fec86e96809ff5a18f08ec156536de84a455 from
OpenVoiceOS/ovos-start-launcher, which reports to start-api.smartgic.io.
